<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Blood Death Knight Tank in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c6">Best in Slot Gear for Blood Death Knight Pre-Raid</span></h2>
