<style>.archon-logo-inline {
   width: 20px;
   height: 20px;
   display: inline;
   margin-bottom: -3px;
}

.archon-section__banner {
   position: relative;
   width: 100%;
   height: 90px;
   border: 1px solid #242424;
   background: linear-gradient(140deg, #060606 0%, #141414 100%);
   font-size: 1.25rem;
   font-weight: 700;
   text-align: center;
   text-wrap: balance;
   text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 1px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8) 0px 1px 2px;
   text-decoration: underline;
   text-underline-offset: 5px;
   text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
   display: flex;
   align-items: center;
   justify-content: center;
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
   .archon-section__banner {
       font-size: 1.75rem;
   }
}

.archon-section__banner-bg-1, .archon-section__banner-bg-2 {
   position: absolute;
   top: 0;
   left: 0;
   bottom: 0;
   right: 0;
   background-position: center;
}

.archon-section__banner-bg-1 {
   mask-image: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0), rgba(0, 0, 0, 1));
   right: 70%;
   background-position-x: 20px;
   background-size: auto;
   background-repeat: no-repeat;
}

.archon-section__banner-bg-2 {
   background-size: cover;
   transform: scaleX(-1);
   mask-image: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), rgba(0, 0, 0, 1));
   filter: blur(4px);
   left: 10%;
}

.archon-section__banner-content {
   z-index: 1;
   padding: 0 50px;
}</style>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="learn-about-popular-gear-with-archon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Learn About Popular Gear With Archon</span></h3>As you gear up your character, you may not have the best gear available for every slot. <a href="https://www.archon.gg">
<img alt="" class="archon-logo-inline" src="https://assets.rpglogs.com/img/archon/logo-64.svg"/> Archon</a> compiles log data from thousands of players and shows <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/knight/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses">the most popular builds and most popular alternatives</a>. At a glance, you can see what other players have done for different types of content.<br/>
<br/>
<a href="https://www.archon.gg/classic-cata/builds/blood/death knight/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses" target="_blank">
<div class="archon-section__banner">
<div class="archon-section__banner-bg-1 lazy-load-background" style="background-image: url('https://assets.rpglogs.com/img/archon/logo-64.svg');"></div>
<div class="archon-section__banner-bg-2 lazy-load-background" style="background-image: url('https://www.archon.gg/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.rpglogs.com%2Fimg%2Fwarcraft%2Fbuilds%2Fspecs%2Fdeath knight-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75');"></div>
<div class="archon-section__banner-content">Blood Death Knight Popular Gear on Archon
       </div></div></a>
<hr/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Blood DK Phase 4</h3>The following list will be a general guideline for which order to pursue items from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> vendor without BIS gear from the previous phase. Take it with a grain of salt, as your current gear will play a big role in what you pursue first<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77317/heartcrusher-wristplates">
<img alt="Heartcrusher Wristplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartcrusher Wristplates</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77170/kneebreaker-boots">
<img alt="Kneebreaker Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kneebreaker Boots</span></a> can be purchased on an alt and sent over to your main or bought on the Auction House if it's an upgrade since it's BOE. <br/>
<br/>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" class="grid markup-table-clean-borders" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c6" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c6" style="width: 40%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c6" style="width: 40%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Price</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77097/dreamcrusher-drape">
<img alt="Dreamcrusher Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamcrusher Drape</span></a></td>
<td>1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77090/necklace-of-black-dragons-teeth">
<img alt="Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bonenecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77092/guardspike-choker">
<img alt="Guardspike Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Guardspike Choker</span></a></td>
<td>1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>
