<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Shoulders for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>In our Shoulder slot, we'll want to go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78751/necrotic-boneplate-shoulderguards">
<img alt="Necrotic Boneplate Shoulderguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necrotic Boneplate Shoulderguards</span></a> during progression, any alternative to the tier shoulders that break the 4 set will be a significant downgrade for the raid, even if the stats are better. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62333/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a> should be your go-to and <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=226462/greater-inscription-of-jagged-stone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_emeraldrough_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone</span></a> will be your damage option. Both from Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
