<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="cloak-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Cloak for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>Ironically, our best defensive alternative don't come with strength, but intellect. I would by and large recommend using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77097/dreamcrusher-drape">
<img alt="Dreamcrusher Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamcrusher Drape</span></a>, but if you really want or need some additional defensive oomph at a big offensive loss, then you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77098/nanoprecise-cape">
<img alt="Nanoprecise Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nanoprecise Cape</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52777/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img alt="Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a>. <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> tinkers stacks with traditional enchants, you'll want to place <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41111/flexweave-underlay">
<img alt="Flexweave Underlay" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flexweave Underlay</span></a> if you're an Engineer.<div class="pad"></div>
