<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gloves-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Gloves for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>In our Glove slot, we'll want to go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78773/necrotic-boneplate-handguards">
<img alt="Necrotic Boneplate Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necrotic Boneplate Handguards</span></a> during progression, any alternative to the tier Gloves that break the 4 set will be a significant downgrade for the raid, even if the stats are better. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <i>Defensive choice</i>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52784/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img alt="Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a> or <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56517/heavy-savage-armor-kit">
<img alt="Heavy Savage Armor Kit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heavy Savage Armor Kit</span></a>
<i> Offensive choice</i>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74254/enchant-gloves-mighty-strength">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mighty Strength</span></a> | For <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> tinkers, the choice should always be <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
