<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Legs for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>In our Leg slot, we'll want to go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78811/necrotic-boneplate-legguards">
<img alt="Necrotic Boneplate Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necrotic Boneplate Legguards</span></a> during progression, any alternative to the tier Legs that break the 4 set will be a significant downgrade for the raid, even if the stats are better. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor: </b>
<i>Defensive Choice:</i> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71720/drakehide-leg-armor">
<img alt="Drakehide Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cataclysmarmorkit_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drakehide Leg Armor</span></a> <i>Offensive Choice</i>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56551/charscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Charscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charscale Leg Armor</span></a>
