<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="boots-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Boots for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>For our Boots, there's one clear alternative with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77170/kneebreaker-boots">
<img alt="Kneebreaker Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kneebreaker Boots</span></a> that stands out above the rest. They are from Valor, so farming them out on an alt or buying them from the auction house may be an option if you're running into the Valor cap.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52743/enchant-boots-earthen-vitality">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Earthen Vitality" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Earthen Vitality</span></a> | We are the slowest tanking spec, we need run speed wherever we can get it.<div class="pad"></div>
