<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="defensive-trinkets-for-blood-death-knight">Defensive Trinkets for Blood Death Knight</h4>We'll have many great stamina Trinkets at our disposal before we head into raid. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77983/indomitable-pride">
<img alt="Indomitable Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_rebirth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Indomitable Pride</span></a> stands out as a particularly great option, especially against hard-hitting bosses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<ins>
<span class="q5">Special Note:</span></ins></b> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62471/mirror-of-broken-images">
<img alt="Mirror of Broken Images" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_platnumdisks.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirror of Broken Images</span></a></span> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62466/mirror-of-broken-images">
<img alt="Mirror of Broken Images" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_platnumdisks.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirror of Broken Images</span></a></span> has seen a lot of use in Cataclysm. However, in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> there'll be limited use for our trusted old friend. It can be used to reduce the damage of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=104322/psychic-drain">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_shadowstep.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Psychic Drain</span></a> (thus reducing the healing the boss receives) on <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=55308/warlord-zonozz">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Warlord Zon'ozz</span></a>, but from a defensive perspective, you'll be much better off using stamina trinkets in this tier.<div class="pad"></div>
