<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78487/gurthalak-voice-of-the-deeps">
<img alt="Gurthalak, Voice of the Deeps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gurthalak, Voice of the Deeps</span></a>, despite not having any secondary stat, is what I would generally recommend. The DPS gain is 1.5k over any other alternative. <br/>
<br/>You do miss out on some secondary stats, so if you are someone who doesn't care about offensive output, then there are three other alternatives for you. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Runeforge</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_retributionaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Fallen Crusader</span></a> will be your best Weapon enchant.<div class="pad"></div>
