<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Relics for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>There's generally not much variance in the Relic department and Phase 4 is no exception to that rule. You'll have 2 Relics to realistically choose from. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77081/gutripper-shard">
<img alt="Gutripper Shard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gutripper Shard</span></a> as your defensive BIS and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71587/relic-of-the-elemental-lords">
<img alt="Relic of the Elemental Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of the Elemental Lords</span></a> as your offensive BIS.<div class="pad"></div>
